<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hellŭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hēluo</span></b> ), ōnis,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a gormandizer</i>, <i>glutton</i>, <i>squanderer</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fraus, helluo, Ganeo!</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Heaut. 5, 4, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ille gurges atque helluo, natus abdomini suo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 17, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">impurus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Agr. 1, 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">me ipsum ut contempsit helluo patriae!</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Sest. 11, 26</span></i>
			.</div>
